# Allow-list build context for the API image (Dockerfile).
# Everything is excluded unless re-included below — this keeps .env files,
# node_modules, dist/, the 22 GB qguard-messaging tree, browser profiles and
# internal material out of the context and out of every image layer.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src
!tools
!supabase/functions/billing
!public/downloads/QGuard-Messaging-Setup.exe

# Never ship, even inside allowed folders
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/.semgrep
tools/qguard-agent/dist
tools/agent-installer-tests/out
